{"type":"thinking","subtype":"delta","text":"\n\nThe retry amplification risk is bounded by the existing three-run cap. The production leak was a polluted re-prompt and extra spawns; now the prompt is clean, though raw-text retries may still occur for broken blocks.\n\nA new concern is whether the retry prompt uses raw `attempt_texts` rather than stripped `collected_texts`. Feeding unstripped content back would reintroduce the broken block.\n\nI will inspect `_incomplete_tool_step_prompt` and the stream handler to verify that stripped text is passed into the retry prompt.","session_id":"81f4d8b7-02cf-45e0-8b1e-62e9a8ce8268","timestamp_ms":1792866821595}
